        cov = f"{v['mature_coverage']:.2%}" if v["mature_coverage"] is not None else "N/A"
        timely = f"{v['timely_coverage']:.2%}" if v["timely_coverage"] is not None else "N/A"
        lines.append(f"|{s}|{cov}|{timely}|{delay}|{v['qualified_16_bar_windows']}|")
    lines += [
        "",
        f"五个参考ETF同时满足窗口的次数：{r['reference_arrivals']['all_five_qualified_16_bar_windows']}。",
        "仅部分下午时段；缺柱不能一概解释为网络丢包。未产生ML03预测或盈利证据。",
